WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.060
Above here.

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:05.230
Isaac's main body is up there.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.020
We've finally reached it.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.200
Wh-What's this?

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:29.920
At last, I've attained it.
The Rosenthals' wish for 400 years--

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:33.920
a perfect soul and a perfect body!

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.770
This is a being on par with being a god!

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:48.310
The perfect golem!

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.780
This power... Don't tell me
Isaac's evolution is complete...

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.700
It looks like time is up.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.960
I can't reflect! What is this craptastic power?

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:27.480
"A Certain Scientific Accelerator"

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.840
"#12 Something to Protect"

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:43.350
W-We are going to enact absolute
justice in Academy City!

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.680
We are justice!

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:47.220
--Justice!
--Justice!

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.730
Justice!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.450
What feels so oppressive?

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.290
Is this part of that monster's power?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:10.120
If anything like that flash
earlier is used in an urban area,

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.370
it's going to multiply the damage done.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:17.590
This is it! This! This! The more I eat,
the greater my power becomes!

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:31.440
I can keep gaining power like this.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:35.110
I'll become the ultimate being,
beyond even a god.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:39.570
Once that happens,
I can bring true justice to Academy City.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.740
What did I just say?

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:46.870
True justice for the city... Justice...

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.410
True justice...

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:54.880
Justice... Justice... Justice... Justice...

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.590
Justice... Justice...

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.880
Justice...

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:07.260
Justice... Justice...

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.020
The power has vanished.

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:13.940
Doesn't matter, as long as
we can keep moving forward.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.320
I can just barely make it.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:27.620
There's no wind here. But if I take the
rotation of the earth we're standing on,

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:31.120
the earth's orbital force around
the sun, and all other forces...

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.870
...and convert them to something I want...

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:49.050
Good, I can pull this off.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.980
Wh-What the...?

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:07.660
Justice... Justice... Justice...

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:13.330
Wait, what is this? Wah, there's
so much noise coming from inside me!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:17.250
This is my body!

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:33.220
Guess my battery managed to last long enough.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.680
I knew it...

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:38.350
"What do you mean by that?" questions Misaka.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:44.610
Master, thank you very much.
Allow me to take it from here.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.540
Adonai, hurry!

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:15.560
Isaac!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.520
Say your prayers!

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:22.190
Stop, Esther! I don't want to die again!

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.660
Adonai!

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:45.500
Don't fall for that, you idiot!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:51.680
How low the Rosenthals have fallen,
if a dunce like you is our head!

00:06:55.140 --> 00:07:00.480
That's absolutely right.
Just how big a moron are you?

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:07.480
I thought you were going to be the hero!
That's why you've come all this way!

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:10.200
So don't backpedal!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:13.820
Like I told you,
if there's something you want to save,

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:17.330
then don't hesitate to stretch out your
hand and protect it for all you're worth!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:21.210
All right, Master.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:28.260
Tch, I told you, I'm not your master.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:32.340
Done with your little talk?
Then it's about time...

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:36.310
...to enact justice... Justice...

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:39.980
Justice... Justice...

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.980
Huh?

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.750
Wh-What is this? What's happening?

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:13.050
Why, you! What the hell did you do?!

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:20.520
Despite having obtained a power
on the same level as a god,

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:23.440
you're still in Hirumi's form...

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:29.730
Which is to say, you're still hooked up
to the coffin containing Hirumi's body...

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:34.410
And so...

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:37.530
"...using the Misaka Network,
we accessed the coffin

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:42.330
and shut down its functions,"
Misaka continues explaining.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.670
It may be impossible to kill you,

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:49.340
but at least we managed to buy some time...

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.010
Why, you...!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:56.430
"This is what you get for toying with
the memories of 10,031 Sisters' deaths,"

00:08:56.430 --> 00:09:00.010
declares Misaka with a smug look.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:03.230
Why, you!

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:14.820
What a shame. You lose!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:20.030
A-After coming this far,
I can't afford to be beaten now!

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:24.790
I will fight with you, Adonai.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:30.130
"Misaka will help, too," says Misaka,
finding her purpose for being here.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:37.890
S-Stop! Don't do it, damn you!
I still have so much I want to do!

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.800
Don't do it!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:58.820
Too bad. You lose.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.580
Go ahead, hero.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:30.690
Wh-Who are you? All you've done is
interfere with me! Who the hell are you?!

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.900
A villain.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:37.740
A son-of-a-bitch villain, just like you!

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.300
Esther...

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:02.470
Hirumi...

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:13.440
Did I prove useful to you?

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:24.330
Welcome back... and farewell... Hirumi...

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:27.620
Bye-bye, Brother.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.960
Hirumi!

00:11:55.360 --> 00:12:01.610
I didn't get to be a hero... mm-mm...

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.720
Is it over?

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:33.520
What's that?

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:52.450
"Ah, this is--

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:57.130
The vast, uninterpretable
power built-up inside Isaac's body

00:12:57.130 --> 00:13:01.510
is causing distortions not only in space,
but in the Misaka Network, as well,"

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:04.090
explains Misaka.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.720
So what if it is?

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:09.600
"If this energy is released upon Isaac's death,

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.520
it will cause an explosive disintegration,

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.480
leveling everything in
a radius of one-half kilometer.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:16.770
Further, the shockwave
will devastate Academy City,"

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.360
Misaka further explains.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.110
Oh, no...

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:38.170
I can't disperse it with vector manipulation.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:42.630
Does this have more of that crap
mixed in with it? Either way,

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.720
it has to be done.

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:50.350
If that damn hero isn't around,
<i>I'll</i> have to do it!

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.220
If nothing else...

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:57.480
...if there's a chance that it might reach her...

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:03.530
...I'll have to do this as ugly as it takes!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:09.910
I'll pour all the remaining juice
into just doing the calculations.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:12.910
There's no reason to stay standing!

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:19.540
Everything... Everything I have...!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.290
Master!

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:37.690
I'll take control of everything!

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:19.810
Master...

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:28.110
Master... Master... Master!

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:32.320
Please wake up, Master! Please, open your eyes!

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:34.830
Master! Master!

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:40.330
Elect<i>hs</i>ricity... exhaust<i>piw</i>ted<i>2gw</i>...

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:44.040
Rea<i>va</i>son<i>bwer</i>... unknown<i>zca</i>...

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:18.790
The damage is extensive. If we had
been away from here when it happened,

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.660
we might have been in danger as well.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:26.960
It's like I say, this is the safest place to be.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.300
Yes, sir.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:33.340
The darkness runs deep in this city.

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:37.970
Not even that light that pierced
the heavens can reach this place.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:44.600
I wonder how far the
first-ranked power can reach.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:55.570
"Jeez!

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:58.080
Why did you skip today's checkup?!"

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:02.290
asks Misaka Misaka, lecturing you!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:06.130
Buzz off. Once you're done lecturing, go away.

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:09.880
"Ah, Misaka Misaka will do anything for you,

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:12.760
but not go away because she's annoying you,"

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:16.010
she says, drawing a line in the sand.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:20.560
Okay, then go buy me one of those
whatever-they're-called cans of coffee.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:23.270
The one they only sell in School District 14.

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:28.560
"Mm-hmm, okay," says Misaka Misaka,
thrilled at the importance of this mission

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:31.570
as she rushes off to buy one!

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:41.160
Does he have a child, at <i>his</i> age?
No, that couldn't be.

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.580
But she's too young to be his...

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:48.920
Well, let's just leave any
delicate matters untouched.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:50.960
Yo.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.500
You're looking well.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:56.340
Tch, if I really look that way,
you should see an eye doctor.

00:17:56.340 --> 00:18:01.310
Oh, don't be like that.
I'm here to apologize for this whole affair.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.720
Huh?

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:09.650
This incident has wiped out DA.
We've caught all of the survivors.

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.730
I'm terribly sorry.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:16.030
But as a result, we were able
to lance a boil infecting Antiskill.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:22.200
Still, what was that thing, anyway?

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.410
All the report said

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:26.080
was that an experiment by a
researcher named Hishigata Mikihiko

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:29.750
had gotten out of control
and ended up like that.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:34.130
But it was so gruesome, I have to
believe there was more to it than that.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:40.510
Since you were at the center of it,
you must know something, right?

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:42.260
No, I don't.

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:45.350
All I know is that villains were
working together on something,

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:47.810
and it ended up causing a chemical reaction.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.810
Yeah, but...

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:53.070
There wasn't any other damage done, right?

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:58.110
You guys did everything you could
within the bounds of what you <i>could</i> do.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.160
Isn't that enough?

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.330
"Morgue"

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.120
I'm sorry, Huotou.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.540
I...

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:13.840
There is no need to apologize.
I am a pseudo-soul that obeys your commands.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.090
I'm now going to release the spell.

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:20.340
I will return the body of
Hitokawa Hasami to her family,

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:22.680
and you will return to the charm...

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:27.600
...losing all of the memories
I have up to now. Isn't that right?

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:36.480
I knew this is what would happen,
right from that moment.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:40.400
One should not keep using
necromancy to tamper with death!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:44.830
I lost a friend, and when I tried
to bring her back to life, lost her again!

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.870
We should not tamper with death.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:52.670
As we fought together, I came to understand...

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:55.840
...that your decision was not wrong.

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.500
Huotou...

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:01.760
Your master said something.
If you're going to be a hero,

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:05.890
don't hesitate to stretch out your hand
and save what you must save.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:11.730
If you would, Adonai.

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:14.560
All right.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:18.610
Um...

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:24.950
My memories will disappear,
but will I remain in your memories?

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:33.040
Of course you will. I'll never forget you.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.750
I promise.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:36.540
Promise?

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.920
Yeah. I promise.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.050
Right.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:45.390
Also, let me tell you something.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:48.560
This isn't a memory;
it's more of a reminiscence.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:03.570
Master...

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:08.080
I'm not your master.
Don't make me keep saying it.

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:10.120
Thank you, Master.

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:11.830
Tch.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:15.750
I'm not your master, but here's a warning.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:20.000
Mediocre folks like yourself

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:23.840
shouldn't get any more involved
with any damn darkness.

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:31.850
From here on, it's One-Way Traffic.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:37.690
I'll find a path that will lead me
to where the sun shines.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:40.400
Both as the head of the Rosenthal family...

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:44.110
...and as a pupil of my master.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:49.120
Can you do that, all on your own?

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:55.210
Yes.

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:57.960
Because I'm not alone.

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:07.590
"But you see...

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:10.510
...Misaka can look after him
just fine on her own,"

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:14.270
says Misaka Misaka,
rejecting an unsolicited busybody!

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:18.560
"This is just Misaka coming to pay
a visit to thank him once again,"

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:22.730
pleads Misaka, in a nurse-like mood,
her heart all aflutter.

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:24.280
Misaka is doing this!

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:25.190
Misaka will do it.

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:27.860
--No, Misaka will!
--Misaka will do it.

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:30.370
--Misaka is doing it!
--Misaka will do it.

00:22:30.370 --> 00:22:31.280
No, Misaka!

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:37.080
Same crapheap of a city as always.

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:42.290
There were villains creeping around
who plotted this incident, too.

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:47.300
As long as we stay in this city,
villains have to stay villains.

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:51.220
Otherwise, we won't be
able to protect anything.

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:54.640
Huh?

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:31.640
Honestly,

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:36.060
this city never gets boring.
